1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:05,005
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:11,177 --> 00:00:12,971
[Ivy] <i>Everything will be over soon.</i>

3
00:00:13,054 --> 00:00:17,308
<i>This town will finally be freed</i>
<i>from the Ardientes' grip.</i>

4
00:00:17,392 --> 00:00:21,855
[Julio] <i>Relax, Arnaldo.</i>
<i>Nothing can stop your wedding.</i>

5
00:00:21,938 --> 00:00:23,481
[Arnaldo] <i>Ivy's late, Grandpa.</i>

6
00:00:23,565 --> 00:00:24,691
<i>What if she doesn't show up?</i>

7
00:00:24,774 --> 00:00:27,318
<i>Calm, down, my son. Calm down.</i>

8
00:00:27,402 --> 00:00:28,653
<i>She will be here.</i>

9
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:31,489
[Diego] <i>Jepoy, this isn't the</i>
<i>right time for you to interfere.</i>

10
00:00:31,573 --> 00:00:32,657
<i>Ivy has plans.</i>

11
00:00:32,741 --> 00:00:33,867
<i>What do you know about Ivy's plans?</i>

12
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:36,077
-<i>Everything.</i>
-[Emilia] <i>Are you in position?</i>

13
00:00:36,161 --> 00:00:37,328
<i>Ready to fire once the bride arrives.</i>

14
00:00:37,412 --> 00:00:38,455
[grunts]

15
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:45,545
<i>Make sure that Ivy Aguas</i>
<i>doesn't enter the church alive.</i>

16
00:00:45,628 --> 00:00:48,423
<i>Your assassin's unconscious, Emilia.</i>

17
00:00:48,506 --> 00:00:51,968
[Emilia] <i>If you think</i>
<i>I only hired one hitman,</i>

18
00:00:52,051 --> 00:00:53,636
<i>then you're sorely mistaken.</i>

19
00:00:56,681 --> 00:01:00,143
[Ivy] <i>I'm wearing black</i>
<i>because this is the only color</i>

20
00:01:00,226 --> 00:01:02,645
<i>that suits this occasion.</i>

21
00:01:02,729 --> 00:01:05,607
[Emilia] <i>Look how Ivy Aguas</i>
<i>is disrespecting us.</i>

22
00:01:05,690 --> 00:01:08,735
<i>I can't let her do this to the family.</i>

23
00:01:08,818 --> 00:01:10,987
[Julio] <i>What matters to me</i>
<i>is that she came</i>

24
00:01:11,071 --> 00:01:12,739
<i>and that she will marry Arnaldo.</i>

25
00:01:12,822 --> 00:01:16,910
<i>And, in a little while,</i>
<i>she will be an Ardiente.</i>

26
00:01:16,993 --> 00:01:18,912
<i>Now, if she's got something bad planned,</i>

27
00:01:18,995 --> 00:01:23,124
<i>she will suffer like everyone else</i>
<i>who does us wrong.</i>

28
00:01:23,208 --> 00:01:25,794
[Raul] <i>Come to think of it,</i>
<i>that black gown suits her, Papa.</i>

29
00:01:25,877 --> 00:01:27,670
[Emilia] <i>You're right, Raul.</i>
<i>It does suit her.</i>

30
00:01:27,754 --> 00:01:30,048
<i>It's perfect for what</i>
<i>will happen to her later.</i>

31
00:01:31,257 --> 00:01:34,761
[tense music playing]

32
00:01:38,056 --> 00:01:39,724
[priest] Let us all be seated.

33
00:01:41,184 --> 00:01:44,395
We are gathered here today
to witness and celebrate

34
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:47,732
the very special love between Ivy Aguas

35
00:01:47,816 --> 00:01:50,485
and Mayor Arnaldo Ardiente-Torillo,

36
00:01:50,568 --> 00:01:52,320
by joining them in marriage.

37
00:01:55,657 --> 00:02:00,370
[sobbing]

38
00:02:00,453 --> 00:02:01,579
[Anna] Auntie.

39
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,166
[Camia] Anna…

40
00:02:05,250 --> 00:02:08,211
My daughter's marrying a monster!

41
00:02:08,962 --> 00:02:11,381
Her life's in danger!

42
00:02:14,342 --> 00:02:17,679
Auntie, Lily's smart. She can handle this.

43
00:02:18,096 --> 00:02:19,556
She knows what she's doing.

44
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:21,724
We just have to have faith in her.

45
00:02:21,808 --> 00:02:25,728
[sobbing]

46
00:02:30,984 --> 00:02:32,360
Please, don't cry.

47
00:02:33,778 --> 00:02:37,574
Of course, you have the right
to be angry, to be worried.

48
00:02:37,657 --> 00:02:40,577
But Diego and Jepoy are there.

49
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:43,204
I'm sure they won't let
anything bad happen to Lily.

50
00:02:44,497 --> 00:02:47,250
Let's just follow her plans, Auntie.

51
00:02:47,333 --> 00:02:49,168
Besides, you're safer here.

52
00:02:50,211 --> 00:02:51,087
Hush now.

53
00:02:52,797 --> 00:02:54,257
Don't cry anymore.

54
00:02:55,049 --> 00:02:57,468
[priest] If anyone has reasons
why Ivy and Arnaldo

55
00:02:57,552 --> 00:02:59,387
should not be married,

56
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:02,432
speak now or forever hold your peace.

57
00:03:04,809 --> 00:03:08,813
[tense music playing]

58
00:03:13,026 --> 00:03:15,236
[suspenseful music playing]

59
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:18,656
[Emilia] <i>If you think</i>
<i>I only hired one hitman,</i>

60
00:03:18,740 --> 00:03:20,325
<i>then you're mistaken.</i>

61
00:03:20,742 --> 00:03:24,996
<i>If Ivy Aguas happens</i>
<i>to enter the church alive,</i>

62
00:03:25,079 --> 00:03:27,665
<i>what makes you think</i>
<i>she'll get out alive too?</i>

63
00:03:28,416 --> 00:03:31,169
[Diego] <i>You won't win today, Emilia.</i>

64
00:03:31,252 --> 00:03:33,421
-<i>Ivy won't die.</i>
-[beeping sound]

65
00:03:35,965 --> 00:03:39,510
[suspenseful music playing]

66
00:03:41,179 --> 00:03:43,973
[priest] In that case,
let's proceed with the ceremony.

67
00:03:55,151 --> 00:03:58,863
[suspenseful music playing]

68
00:04:00,281 --> 00:04:03,743
[beeping sound]

69
00:04:07,330 --> 00:04:10,291
[beeping continues]

70
00:04:13,253 --> 00:04:16,256
[ominous music]

71
00:04:17,257 --> 00:04:20,468
[beeping]

72
00:04:25,807 --> 00:04:27,308
<i>Sorry, my dear Ivy.</i>

73
00:04:27,392 --> 00:04:28,685
<i>You played the game a bit too well.</i>

74
00:04:28,768 --> 00:04:32,188
<i>So now, it's your turn to get killed.</i>

75
00:04:32,272 --> 00:04:34,816
<i>I'm ready to cry my fake tears for you.</i>

76
00:04:34,899 --> 00:04:38,069
<i>I'm still the queen</i>
<i>of the Ardiente family.</i>

77
00:04:38,152 --> 00:04:40,863
<i>And I will never, ever surrender my crown</i>

78
00:04:40,947 --> 00:04:43,616
<i>to an ambitious nobody like you.</i>

79
00:04:48,204 --> 00:04:52,500
[bomb beeping]

80
00:04:54,210 --> 00:04:56,504
[priest] <i>Today is a celebration of love.</i>

81
00:04:56,587 --> 00:04:58,047
[suspenseful music]

82
00:04:58,131 --> 00:05:01,467
<i>And love alone is not enough</i>
<i>to make a marriage last.</i>

83
00:05:02,719 --> 00:05:06,264
<i>It's important for a couple to follow</i>

84
00:05:06,347 --> 00:05:08,391
<i>and respect the laws of marriage.</i>

85
00:05:09,726 --> 00:05:12,729
<i>And for their families</i>
<i>to guide and support them.</i>

86
00:05:14,230 --> 00:05:20,653
<i>It is also important to understand,</i>
<i>accept, forgive, and trust one another.</i>

87
00:05:20,987 --> 00:05:22,864
[beeping continues]

88
00:05:22,947 --> 00:05:26,159
[priest] <i>Love each other,</i>
<i>even when it hurts.</i>

89
00:05:26,242 --> 00:05:29,704
-[suspenseful music playing]
-[beeping continues]

90
00:05:29,787 --> 00:05:33,666
[priest] <i>Love even when</i>
<i>it is impossible to love.</i>

91
00:05:36,377 --> 00:05:39,088
[beeping continues]

92
00:05:39,172 --> 00:05:42,717
[suspenseful music playing]

93
00:05:43,926 --> 00:05:47,930
[beeping continues]

94
00:05:53,728 --> 00:05:54,854
[explodes]

95
00:05:57,398 --> 00:05:58,775
-[crowd exclaiming]
-[bomb explodes]

96
00:06:00,651 --> 00:06:01,652
Ivy.

97
00:06:06,074 --> 00:06:08,826
[unsettling music playing]

98
00:06:08,910 --> 00:06:10,078
[fire crackling]

99
00:06:13,664 --> 00:06:14,707
[Claire] Julio…

100
00:06:15,249 --> 00:06:16,501
Are we under attack?

101
00:06:16,584 --> 00:06:18,753
No, we're not under attack.

102
00:06:19,712 --> 00:06:24,342
[suspenseful music playing]

103
00:06:25,259 --> 00:06:26,552
What's that?

104
00:06:27,386 --> 00:06:29,013
-You're one of Emilia's hitmen.
-No--

105
00:06:29,097 --> 00:06:31,641
[grunting]

106
00:06:35,728 --> 00:06:37,688
Ladies and gentlemen, please…

107
00:06:37,772 --> 00:06:39,232
Please, don't panic.

108
00:06:39,565 --> 00:06:41,859
You don't have to rush out of the church.

109
00:06:41,943 --> 00:06:46,906
That explosion you just heard
was part of my surprise

110
00:06:46,989 --> 00:06:50,284
for Ivy and Arnaldo's reception later.

111
00:06:50,368 --> 00:06:51,953
So, there's nothing to worry about.

112
00:06:52,411 --> 00:06:55,581
Everything is under control. So, please…

113
00:06:55,665 --> 00:06:56,582
Sit down, please.

114
00:06:57,125 --> 00:07:00,336
I'm guaranteeing this.
Nothing bad happened.

115
00:07:01,462 --> 00:07:02,588
Who else is there?

116
00:07:03,047 --> 00:07:03,965
[grunts]

117
00:07:05,925 --> 00:07:07,260
[grunting]

118
00:07:09,303 --> 00:07:10,930
How many are you here?! Tell me!

119
00:07:12,098 --> 00:07:13,891
-Answer me!
-It's just me!

120
00:07:14,392 --> 00:07:15,518
-Just you?!
-I swear!

121
00:07:15,601 --> 00:07:16,561
[Jepoy] Yeah, right.

122
00:07:16,644 --> 00:07:18,479
You mean you're going
to kill Ivy on your own?

123
00:07:18,563 --> 00:07:19,897
[man grunting]

124
00:07:22,150 --> 00:07:23,776
[panting]

125
00:07:25,319 --> 00:07:28,322
[tense music playing]

126
00:07:37,039 --> 00:07:38,082
Uh…

127
00:07:38,166 --> 00:07:39,792
Continue with the ceremony, please.

128
00:07:40,918 --> 00:07:42,003
Sorry about that.

129
00:07:44,797 --> 00:07:46,090
Everything's okay.

130
00:07:48,176 --> 00:07:52,096
[foreboding music playing]

131
00:07:55,892 --> 00:07:56,893
Sit down.

132
00:08:00,438 --> 00:08:03,107
<i>If you were the ones</i>
<i>behind that explosion,</i>

133
00:08:03,191 --> 00:08:06,694
<i>well, there's nothing you can do</i>
<i>to stop the inevitable.</i>

134
00:08:07,528 --> 00:08:10,156
<i>I spent so long working on this plan.</i>

135
00:08:10,239 --> 00:08:11,824
<i>I made a lot of sacrifices.</i>

136
00:08:11,908 --> 00:08:14,702
<i>I even compromised my humanity</i>

137
00:08:14,785 --> 00:08:17,497
<i>just to get to where I am today.</i>

138
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:20,500
<i>All for the sake of justice.</i>

139
00:08:20,958 --> 00:08:25,922
<i>This plan cannot fail. I will succeed.</i>

140
00:08:32,470 --> 00:08:34,013
Ma'am Camia?

141
00:08:34,096 --> 00:08:35,306
Ma'am Camia?

142
00:08:36,140 --> 00:08:37,099
Uh…

143
00:08:37,808 --> 00:08:40,811
-The wedding's in chaos.
-What?!

144
00:08:43,022 --> 00:08:47,527
[reporter] <i>An explosion</i>
<i>sparked tension at the church</i>

145
00:08:47,610 --> 00:08:50,154
<i>where the wedding between</i>
<i>Mayor Arnaldo Ardiente-Torillo</i>

146
00:08:50,238 --> 00:08:52,240
-<i>and Ivy Aguas is being held.</i>
-Loring, where's Diego?

147
00:08:52,323 --> 00:08:54,242
-Call him.
-[Loring] Hold on.

148
00:08:54,325 --> 00:08:55,493
[line ringing]

149
00:08:55,576 --> 00:08:56,994
[news report on TV continues]

150
00:08:57,078 --> 00:08:59,872
-[line ringing]
-Diego's not picking up.

151
00:08:59,956 --> 00:09:01,707
-[Pandoy] What?!
-[line continues ringing]

152
00:09:03,167 --> 00:09:04,585
[woman on TV] <i>We were just watching…</i>

153
00:09:04,669 --> 00:09:06,879
-So?
-<i>…when something exploded!</i>

154
00:09:06,963 --> 00:09:08,464
[line continues ringing]

155
00:09:08,839 --> 00:09:11,008
[woman on TV] <i>Everyone started</i>
<i>running to the front!</i>

156
00:09:11,092 --> 00:09:12,343
Change the channel.

157
00:09:12,885 --> 00:09:14,929
[reporter] <i>Do you think someone</i>
<i>tried to sabotage the wedding?</i>

158
00:09:15,012 --> 00:09:18,224
[priest] <i>Very well. Ivy and Mayor Arnaldo…</i>

159
00:09:19,058 --> 00:09:22,144
<i>Together, as you light</i>
<i>this candle of unity…</i>

160
00:09:22,228 --> 00:09:25,565
<i>you symbolize the flame</i>
<i>of your individual souls.</i>

161
00:09:25,648 --> 00:09:28,484
<i>Joining to ignite</i>
<i>the partnership of marriage.</i>

162
00:09:28,568 --> 00:09:30,528
[inaudible]

163
00:09:30,611 --> 00:09:34,031
[unsettling music playing]

164
00:09:34,282 --> 00:09:36,284
[Diego panting]

165
00:09:40,788 --> 00:09:45,543
As my family's beloved son,
I was raised to be a winner.

166
00:09:46,002 --> 00:09:48,170
A leader, a conqueror.

167
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:52,592
I grew up getting whatever I wanted.

168
00:09:54,969 --> 00:09:58,764
And then, you came along, Miss Aguas.

169
00:10:00,308 --> 00:10:02,810
<i>I remember the first time I saw you.</i>

170
00:10:02,893 --> 00:10:04,937
<i>I was out hunting in the woods.</i>

171
00:10:05,730 --> 00:10:08,691
It's funny because I was a predator…

172
00:10:09,233 --> 00:10:11,068
trying to catch my prey.

173
00:10:12,945 --> 00:10:14,614
But you captured me instead.

174
00:10:16,866 --> 00:10:19,368
<i>Since that day, I made it</i>
<i>my life's mission</i>

175
00:10:19,452 --> 00:10:21,662
<i>to make you fall in love with me.</i>

176
00:10:22,246 --> 00:10:23,664
[line ringing]

177
00:10:23,748 --> 00:10:25,124
Are you done yet?

178
00:10:25,207 --> 00:10:28,044
We're running out of time.
Arnaldo's reciting his vows!

179
00:10:28,127 --> 00:10:29,587
[Arnaldo] <i>You were a real challenge.</i>

180
00:10:30,171 --> 00:10:31,297
And you knew it.

181
00:10:31,380 --> 00:10:32,632
[chuckles]

182
00:10:33,090 --> 00:10:36,719
But I want you to know
that I enjoyed every second…

183
00:10:37,887 --> 00:10:41,349
every minute of that chase.

184
00:10:44,602 --> 00:10:45,978
[Jepoy] I ran into a sniper.

185
00:10:46,771 --> 00:10:48,147
But he said he was the last one.

186
00:10:50,149 --> 00:10:52,360
[Arnaldo] <i>Seeing you</i>
<i>in this lifetime, Ivy, I…</i>

187
00:10:53,194 --> 00:10:54,904
<i>already said to myself that…</i>

188
00:10:57,031 --> 00:10:59,033
no one can ever bring me down.

189
00:11:00,576 --> 00:11:01,744
But you?

190
00:11:02,370 --> 00:11:03,663
You brought me down my knees.

191
00:11:06,248 --> 00:11:07,625
<i>You're the woman who brought me down.</i>

192
00:11:07,708 --> 00:11:09,168
[inaudible]

193
00:11:09,251 --> 00:11:12,463
<i>But only because I proposed,</i>
<i>and you said yes.</i>

194
00:11:12,546 --> 00:11:13,964
And for that, I'm grateful.

195
00:11:14,673 --> 00:11:15,674
Now…

196
00:11:16,342 --> 00:11:20,846
we have a lifetime of love
and happiness ahead of us.

197
00:11:21,639 --> 00:11:26,602
[ominous music playing]

198
00:11:40,741 --> 00:11:42,410
I can't wait.

199
00:11:48,541 --> 00:11:52,670
<i>In the eyes of the law,</i>
<i>within this church…</i>

200
00:11:56,549 --> 00:11:58,551
<i>and in front of the whole world…</i>

201
00:11:58,634 --> 00:12:00,553
[inaudible]

202
00:12:02,638 --> 00:12:03,973
You are mine,

203
00:12:05,057 --> 00:12:06,517
and I'm yours.

204
00:12:09,353 --> 00:12:11,814
And I can't wait to spend
a lifetime with you.

205
00:12:13,774 --> 00:12:17,027
And only death will tear us apart.

206
00:12:21,490 --> 00:12:25,494
[tense music playing]

207
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:39,467
[priest] <i>Ivy, I believe you also prepared</i>
<i>your wedding vow for Arnaldo.</i>

208
00:12:40,843 --> 00:12:41,969
<i>Of course.</i>

209
00:12:42,845 --> 00:12:47,475
[foreboding music playing]

210
00:12:48,184 --> 00:12:50,478
Diego, Ivy is about to recite her vows!

211
00:12:50,561 --> 00:12:51,687
I know! Be patient!

212
00:12:51,770 --> 00:12:53,272
Is everything still going as planned?!

213
00:12:55,941 --> 00:12:57,318
Arnaldo…

214
00:13:01,947 --> 00:13:05,451
This is the day
that I have been waiting for.

215
00:13:05,534 --> 00:13:07,328
-[line ringing]
-Come on, answer your phone!

216
00:13:07,411 --> 00:13:09,830
[Ivy] <i>The moment I've always dreamed of…</i>

217
00:13:11,332 --> 00:13:14,043
Thank you for your love, Arnaldo.

218
00:13:16,045 --> 00:13:21,592
You accepted me, and so did your family,

219
00:13:22,885 --> 00:13:27,223
<i>despite that fact that I am an orphan.</i>

220
00:13:28,766 --> 00:13:32,853
<i>I lost my adoptive family early on.</i>

221
00:13:33,479 --> 00:13:35,064
But despite that, I am blessed.

222
00:13:36,398 --> 00:13:38,192
Because I met…

223
00:13:41,278 --> 00:13:43,364
I met Nanny Carlotta.

224
00:13:46,742 --> 00:13:49,828
Diego! I can't wait any longer!
What happened to your plan?!

225
00:13:52,498 --> 00:13:55,167
-I will finish Arnaldo off!
-[Ivy] <i>Nanny Carlotta, who…</i>

226
00:13:55,834 --> 00:13:59,046
<i>treated me as a daughter.</i>

227
00:14:02,341 --> 00:14:04,134
Nanny Carlotta…

228
00:14:05,636 --> 00:14:08,180
<i>…gave me everything.</i>

229
00:14:08,973 --> 00:14:10,975
She devoted her life to me…

230
00:14:12,643 --> 00:14:14,019
up until her last breath.

231
00:14:14,103 --> 00:14:16,230
[tense music playing]

232
00:14:21,944 --> 00:14:24,321
That's why when I lost Nanny Carlotta,

233
00:14:26,323 --> 00:14:28,534
my world was shattered.

234
00:14:31,036 --> 00:14:33,122
Jepoy! What are you doing?!

235
00:14:33,205 --> 00:14:35,666
-That's not gonna help Ivy!
-You're not helping either!

236
00:14:35,749 --> 00:14:36,792
Can't you be more patient?!

237
00:14:36,876 --> 00:14:38,377
We're waiting for nothing, Diego!

238
00:14:40,546 --> 00:14:42,214
[Ivy] <i>But fortunately…</i>

239
00:14:42,882 --> 00:14:44,842
<i>you were there for me.</i>

240
00:14:46,385 --> 00:14:49,263
You were there for me
when I was devastated,

241
00:14:49,346 --> 00:14:53,058
and the love you offered comforted me.

242
00:14:54,018 --> 00:14:55,561
We need to do something now!

243
00:14:55,644 --> 00:14:57,605
[Ivy] Arnaldo, thank you
for your understanding…

244
00:14:59,481 --> 00:15:01,859
and for your honesty.

245
00:15:05,946 --> 00:15:07,448
That's why today…

246
00:15:08,407 --> 00:15:09,408
[clears throat]

247
00:15:10,868 --> 00:15:12,953
I will make you feel…

248
00:15:13,787 --> 00:15:20,085
my true and burning desire.

249
00:15:22,338 --> 00:15:26,300
[foreboding music playing]

250
00:15:31,305 --> 00:15:34,934
[sobbing]

251
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:42,775
[priest] <i>Do you, Arnaldo,</i>

252
00:15:43,609 --> 00:15:46,362
take Ivy to be your lawfully wedded wife?

253
00:15:46,445 --> 00:15:48,572
To share your life openly,

254
00:15:49,114 --> 00:15:52,242
standing with her in sickness
and in health…

255
00:15:52,326 --> 00:15:54,244
We can't just outright stop the wedding!

256
00:15:54,328 --> 00:15:57,623
You saw their armed men!
They'll shoot at us!

257
00:15:58,749 --> 00:15:59,625
What's your plan?!

258
00:15:59,708 --> 00:16:03,045
[priest] <i>In joy and in sorrow,</i>
<i>in hardship and in ease…</i>

259
00:16:05,339 --> 00:16:07,800
to cherish and love forevermore?

260
00:16:08,342 --> 00:16:11,428
<i>Do you promise</i>
<i>with all your heart and soul</i>

261
00:16:11,512 --> 00:16:14,974
<i>to honor this vow, till death do you part?</i>

262
00:16:15,057 --> 00:16:18,060
[foreboding music playing]

263
00:16:19,061 --> 00:16:21,105
Uh… I do.

264
00:16:23,565 --> 00:16:24,525
I do.

265
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:34,702
[priest] Do you, Ivy,

266
00:16:34,785 --> 00:16:38,163
take Arnaldo to be
your lawfully wedded husband?

267
00:16:38,747 --> 00:16:40,499
To share your life openly,

268
00:16:41,041 --> 00:16:42,376
<i>standing with him</i>

269
00:16:42,459 --> 00:16:44,753
<i>in sickness and in health…</i>

270
00:16:44,837 --> 00:16:47,381
[sobbing] No!

271
00:16:47,464 --> 00:16:52,720
[priest] In joy and in sorrow,
in hardship and in ease…

272
00:16:54,930 --> 00:16:56,390
<i>To cherish and love forevermore?</i>

273
00:16:56,473 --> 00:16:57,683
[Jepoy] What now?!

274
00:16:59,768 --> 00:17:02,312
[priest] Do you promise
with all your heart and soul

275
00:17:02,396 --> 00:17:07,860
to honor this vow till death do you part?

276
00:17:07,943 --> 00:17:11,488
[suspenseful music playing]

277
00:17:14,575 --> 00:17:15,617
Well?!

278
00:17:16,952 --> 00:17:18,454
[pants]

279
00:17:18,537 --> 00:17:22,416
[suspenseful music playing]

280
00:17:28,005 --> 00:17:31,300
[priest] Do you, Ivy, take Arnaldo…

281
00:17:31,383 --> 00:17:33,469
to be your lawfully wedded husband,

282
00:17:33,552 --> 00:17:35,554
to share your life openly,

283
00:17:35,637 --> 00:17:39,641
standing with him
in sickness and in health…

284
00:17:39,725 --> 00:17:41,518
<i>in joy and in sorrow…</i>

285
00:17:41,602 --> 00:17:44,104
<i>in hardship and in ease,</i>

286
00:17:44,188 --> 00:17:46,648
<i>to cherish and love forevermore?</i>

287
00:17:49,610 --> 00:17:53,572
[suspenseful music playing]

288
00:17:54,948 --> 00:17:57,576
[priest] <i>Do you promise</i>
<i>with all your heart and soul</i>

289
00:17:57,659 --> 00:18:01,789
<i>to honor this vow till death do you part?</i>

290
00:18:02,372 --> 00:18:06,335
[suspenseful music playing]

291
00:18:07,002 --> 00:18:08,212
[sobs]

292
00:18:12,549 --> 00:18:13,550
Hon?

293
00:18:24,937 --> 00:18:25,938
Hey!

294
00:18:27,231 --> 00:18:28,398
Diego!

295
00:18:29,733 --> 00:18:33,737
[suspenseful music playing]

296
00:18:48,919 --> 00:18:52,965
[suspenseful music continues]

297
00:19:05,936 --> 00:19:07,146
Stop the wedding!

298
00:19:16,655 --> 00:19:18,532
-Auntie, it's Diego!
-Is that Diego?

299
00:19:19,825 --> 00:19:21,660
-Is that Diego?
-Diego?

300
00:19:36,258 --> 00:19:40,220
[suspenseful music playing]

301
00:19:51,773 --> 00:19:55,736
[suspenseful music continues]

302
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:11,168
[Fernan] Stay calm, okay?
There are soldiers.

303
00:20:11,251 --> 00:20:12,586
[Marlon] Let's be careful.

304
00:20:13,170 --> 00:20:14,713
Sir, don't shoot!

305
00:20:15,088 --> 00:20:16,048
We're unarmed!

306
00:20:16,131 --> 00:20:17,925
-We're unarmed!
-We're just going to watch.

307
00:20:18,008 --> 00:20:19,927
Relax, we're just going to watch.

308
00:20:20,010 --> 00:20:22,971
[tense music playing]

309
00:20:25,057 --> 00:20:26,725
What do you think you're doing?

310
00:20:27,392 --> 00:20:28,393
[Arnaldo] Well?

311
00:20:31,939 --> 00:20:32,898
Auntie…

312
00:20:32,981 --> 00:20:35,984
[tense music playing]

313
00:20:36,318 --> 00:20:37,986
What do you think you're doing?!

314
00:20:38,070 --> 00:20:40,197
You insolent fool!

315
00:20:45,911 --> 00:20:47,913
-[Fernan] Hey, we're unarmed!
-[Marlon] We're unarmed!

316
00:20:47,996 --> 00:20:49,289
Don't shoot!

317
00:20:49,373 --> 00:20:51,166
-Guys, be careful!
-Sir, you're not allowed here!

318
00:20:51,250 --> 00:20:53,043
Let us pass, we just want to watch!

319
00:20:53,126 --> 00:20:55,128
Don't shoot, we're just going to watch.

320
00:20:55,212 --> 00:20:56,213
Let us in!

321
00:20:56,588 --> 00:20:58,507
[unintelligible]

322
00:20:58,590 --> 00:21:00,300
[clamoring]

323
00:21:00,384 --> 00:21:02,344
Ivy, you can't marry that man!

324
00:21:04,137 --> 00:21:06,640
Why? Who are you to stop us?

325
00:21:07,599 --> 00:21:08,600
Who are you?

326
00:21:18,235 --> 00:21:22,155
[suspenseful music playing]

327
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:35,502
<i>The bullet-ridden body</i>
<i>of a 21-year-old woman</i>

328
00:21:35,585 --> 00:21:38,338
<i>identified as Nimfa Naig</i>
<i>was found this morning.</i>

329
00:21:39,464 --> 00:21:42,426
<i>The investigation is still ongoing</i>

330
00:21:42,509 --> 00:21:46,054
<i>to find the perpetrator</i>
<i>of this heinous crime.</i>

331
00:21:46,138 --> 00:21:49,182
<i>As of now, the authorities</i>
<i>are yet to name their suspects.</i>

332
00:21:49,266 --> 00:21:53,103
<i>The police are also investigating</i>
<i>the possible motives for the murder.</i>

333
00:21:53,979 --> 00:21:57,149
[tense music playing]

334
00:21:59,735 --> 00:22:03,655
<i>The 43-year-old Carlotta Navarro</i>
<i>was found dead in an apparent suicide</i>

335
00:22:03,739 --> 00:22:05,324
<i>inside the home of wealthy businesswoman</i>

336
00:22:05,407 --> 00:22:08,535
<i>and known supporter</i>
<i>of the Ardientes, Ivy Aguas.</i>

337
00:22:08,618 --> 00:22:10,037
[sobs] Aunt Carlotta!

338
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:11,580
[reporter] <i>It is said that</i>
<i>personal problems…</i>

339
00:22:11,663 --> 00:22:13,373
My Aunt Carlotta!

340
00:22:13,457 --> 00:22:14,875
[reporter] <i>…pushed her to commit suicide.</i>

341
00:22:14,958 --> 00:22:18,420
<i>There are reports that</i>
<i>she was allegedly deep in debt.</i>

342
00:22:18,503 --> 00:22:20,213
-<i>She's Aguas' foster mother.</i>
-What's the meaning of--

343
00:22:20,297 --> 00:22:21,298
Turn this off!

344
00:22:21,381 --> 00:22:23,884
-<i>No statement has been given…</i>
-[stammers] What is this?

345
00:22:23,967 --> 00:22:25,135
Turn this off! Turn this off!

346
00:22:25,218 --> 00:22:28,096
[Arnaldo] <i>You won't get</i>
<i>your money until I get Ivy.</i>

347
00:22:29,514 --> 00:22:33,560
<i>Where is she? I want to see her.</i>
<i>I want to talk to her.</i>

348
00:22:33,643 --> 00:22:34,978
[Arthur chuckling]

349
00:22:36,563 --> 00:22:38,106
[Arthur] <i>That's not going to happen!</i>

350
00:22:40,275 --> 00:22:44,613
<i>Give me my money first,</i>
<i>and then I'll tell you where she is.</i>

351
00:22:44,696 --> 00:22:46,114
[sobs]

352
00:22:47,574 --> 00:22:50,952
Uh… I-- I said turn this off!

353
00:22:51,036 --> 00:22:53,580
-Who's in charge here?!
-I am, sir.

354
00:22:53,663 --> 00:22:56,041
-[Arnaldo] Then turn this off!
-Do something! Turn that off!

355
00:22:56,124 --> 00:22:57,292
[woman] Sir, we can't do anything.

356
00:22:57,375 --> 00:22:58,668
-Even if we turn this off…
-[Julio] What?!

357
00:22:58,752 --> 00:23:01,004
…it's on a simultaneous feed
throughout all of Ardiente.

358
00:23:01,088 --> 00:23:03,715
The live feed is coming
from the Ardiente TV stations,

359
00:23:03,799 --> 00:23:05,133
not from our systems.

360
00:23:05,217 --> 00:23:06,635
We have no control.

361
00:23:06,718 --> 00:23:08,720
The whole town of Ardiente
is watching this.

362
00:23:08,804 --> 00:23:10,597
-Who did this?! Huh?!
-[Raul] Arnaldo!

363
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:12,599
Who?! Tell me!

364
00:23:12,682 --> 00:23:15,060
-Arnaldo. Arnaldo…
-Tell me who it is!

365
00:23:15,143 --> 00:23:16,228
Tell me! Tell me!

366
00:23:16,311 --> 00:23:18,772
[Julio] You're getting paid
so do something about this!

367
00:23:19,314 --> 00:23:24,778
[both grunting]

368
00:23:26,071 --> 00:23:30,075
[both grunting]

369
00:23:36,081 --> 00:23:39,042
-[suspenseful music]
-[Arnaldo] <i>Fight! Fight back!</i>

370
00:23:42,504 --> 00:23:44,297
<i>Thank you, Arthur.</i>

371
00:23:49,886 --> 00:23:53,265
[Arnaldo] <i>Fight back! Come on! Fight back!</i>

372
00:23:55,851 --> 00:23:57,644
[Arnaldo] <i>What do you think?</i>

373
00:23:58,395 --> 00:23:59,980
<i>You think you can order me around?</i>

374
00:24:00,063 --> 00:24:04,401
<i>You think you can bring me down</i>
<i>without a fight, huh?! No!</i>

375
00:24:05,026 --> 00:24:06,528
<i>You're a nobody!</i>

376
00:24:06,611 --> 00:24:08,155
<i>And I'm the mayor!</i>

377
00:24:08,238 --> 00:24:11,074
<i>Keep that in mind!</i>

378
00:24:11,158 --> 00:24:12,868
[Arthur] <i>I've got Ivy Aguas!</i>

379
00:24:12,951 --> 00:24:17,080
[Arnaldo] <i>Well, I have you now!</i>
<i>I have your phone too!</i>

380
00:24:17,164 --> 00:24:20,458
<i>I can order your accomplice to let Ivy go.</i>

381
00:24:20,542 --> 00:24:22,961
<i>And I can kill you too.</i>

382
00:24:23,044 --> 00:24:24,963
[tense music plays]

383
00:24:33,263 --> 00:24:34,514
<i>I can easily kill you</i>

384
00:24:34,598 --> 00:24:37,058
<i>and make it look</i>
<i>like you committed suicide,</i>

385
00:24:37,142 --> 00:24:39,269
<i>just like I did to Carlotta.</i>

386
00:24:39,352 --> 00:24:41,688
[tense music playing]

387
00:24:43,523 --> 00:24:45,066
[inaudible]

388
00:24:45,150 --> 00:24:46,318
What?

389
00:24:46,401 --> 00:24:47,903
[sobs]

390
00:24:48,445 --> 00:24:49,487
Arnaldo!

391
00:24:49,571 --> 00:24:51,573
[breathing heavily]

392
00:24:51,948 --> 00:24:53,158
-You heard that?
-He killed her?

393
00:24:53,241 --> 00:24:54,659
So it was him!

394
00:24:54,743 --> 00:24:57,495
[overlapping chatter]

395
00:24:57,871 --> 00:24:59,956
[tense music playing]

396
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:03,126
<i>Or I can also pin the blame</i>
<i>on someone else…</i>

397
00:25:04,419 --> 00:25:06,755
<i>just like how I framed Diego</i>
<i>when I killed Nimfa.</i>

398
00:25:06,838 --> 00:25:08,840
[tense music playing]

399
00:25:11,218 --> 00:25:13,011
You killed my daughter!

400
00:25:14,971 --> 00:25:16,264
[Arnaldo] <i>What now, Arthur?</i>

401
00:25:18,475 --> 00:25:20,852
<i>I always get what I want.</i>

402
00:25:22,562 --> 00:25:23,647
Arnaldo!

403
00:25:23,730 --> 00:25:26,524
<i>So give me back my fiancée</i>
<i>before I blow your brains out.</i>

404
00:25:26,608 --> 00:25:29,903
Turn that thing off! Turn it off!

405
00:25:30,278 --> 00:25:33,031
Turn it off right now! Turn it off!

406
00:25:33,114 --> 00:25:35,492
[guests exclaiming]

407
00:25:35,575 --> 00:25:36,993
-<i>I'll kill--</i>
-[grunts]

408
00:25:37,077 --> 00:25:38,495
[woman] Oh, my goodness!

409
00:25:40,080 --> 00:25:41,581
Please calm down!

410
00:25:41,665 --> 00:25:42,666
[clamoring]

411
00:25:42,749 --> 00:25:45,335
[unintelligible]

412
00:25:45,418 --> 00:25:48,380
[tense music playing]

413
00:25:50,131 --> 00:25:51,883
This is all on you.

414
00:25:53,260 --> 00:25:54,636
You planned all this.

415
00:25:55,637 --> 00:25:56,930
Is it true?

416
00:25:57,013 --> 00:26:00,475
[tense music playing]

417
00:26:07,357 --> 00:26:10,527
Arnaldo, is that true?

418
00:26:16,241 --> 00:26:19,494
Is it true that you killed Nanny Carlotta?

419
00:26:20,161 --> 00:26:22,080
[suspenseful music]

420
00:26:36,511 --> 00:26:40,473
[suspenseful music playing]

421
00:26:44,352 --> 00:26:46,730
[breathing heavily]

422
00:26:46,813 --> 00:26:50,817
[suspenseful music playing]

423
00:26:52,277 --> 00:26:54,612
-Ivy…
-Answer me.

424
00:26:57,282 --> 00:26:58,908
Answer me!

425
00:27:00,952 --> 00:27:03,413
Ivy, that's not true.
He's just trying to ruin us.

426
00:27:03,496 --> 00:27:05,749
[stutters] This is all part
of Diego's plan.

427
00:27:05,832 --> 00:27:08,084
He's just trying to ruin our wedding--

428
00:27:08,168 --> 00:27:09,753
You're not answering my question.

429
00:27:09,836 --> 00:27:11,421
Did you kill Nanny Carlotta?!

430
00:27:12,464 --> 00:27:14,716
-Ivy…
-Don't touch me!

431
00:27:17,135 --> 00:27:19,596
Did you kill Nanny Carlotta?!

432
00:27:21,806 --> 00:27:23,892
[ominous music playing]

433
00:27:23,975 --> 00:27:25,977
[muffled screams]

434
00:27:35,111 --> 00:27:36,529
I'm in charge. I'm in charge.

435
00:27:37,447 --> 00:27:39,574
I'm in charge. I'm in charge.
I'm in charge.

436
00:27:39,783 --> 00:27:41,034
Uh…

437
00:27:45,246 --> 00:27:46,289
<i>Uh…</i>

438
00:27:49,459 --> 00:27:51,461
I'm in charge.
I'm in charge. I'm in charge.

439
00:27:51,961 --> 00:27:52,962
Uh…

440
00:27:57,050 --> 00:27:58,510
It was an accident.

441
00:27:58,593 --> 00:28:03,139
[suspenseful music playing]

442
00:28:03,556 --> 00:28:04,891
[sobbing]

443
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:13,108
[overlapping dialogue]

444
00:28:13,191 --> 00:28:16,111
That can't be! The mayor
wouldn't do such a thing!

445
00:28:18,571 --> 00:28:21,449
It was an accident. It was an accident.

446
00:28:21,991 --> 00:28:23,952
-It was an accident.
-You didn't--

447
00:28:24,702 --> 00:28:27,038
-You didn't mean to?
-I didn't mean it.

448
00:28:28,081 --> 00:28:28,998
It was an accident.

449
00:28:29,082 --> 00:28:30,500
But you killed her?

450
00:28:31,501 --> 00:28:35,588
<i>Who did this to you?!</i>

451
00:28:36,631 --> 00:28:39,676
<i>Tell me!</i>

452
00:28:39,759 --> 00:28:42,804
[suspenseful music playing]

453
00:28:43,847 --> 00:28:45,682
So you really killed her?

454
00:28:46,558 --> 00:28:47,851
Monster!

455
00:28:47,934 --> 00:28:50,270
-I didn't mean it!
-You bastard!

456
00:28:50,353 --> 00:28:51,771
[Ivy screams]

457
00:28:55,275 --> 00:28:57,819
-Why did you kill her?! Why?!
-I didn't mean to!

458
00:28:57,902 --> 00:28:59,988
-What did she do to you?!
-I didn't mean to!

459
00:29:00,071 --> 00:29:01,781
Why did you kill her?!

460
00:29:01,865 --> 00:29:04,951
-[guests exclaiming]
-Bastard!

461
00:29:05,577 --> 00:29:07,495
-You monster!
-No, no…

462
00:29:07,579 --> 00:29:08,872
You demon!

463
00:29:08,955 --> 00:29:09,956
No, no, no, no!

464
00:29:10,039 --> 00:29:11,416
-Why did you kill her?!
-It was an accident!

465
00:29:11,499 --> 00:29:12,959
-I didn't mean it!
-Why?

466
00:29:14,794 --> 00:29:16,421
[Arnaldo sobs] I didn't mean it!

467
00:29:16,504 --> 00:29:18,840
-Ivy, please have mercy…
-You monster!

468
00:29:18,923 --> 00:29:21,551
Why should I have mercy on you?!

469
00:29:21,926 --> 00:29:23,887
Did you have mercy on her?!

470
00:29:23,970 --> 00:29:27,849
You hanged her! You killed her!

471
00:29:27,932 --> 00:29:30,143
-You heartless monster!
-[Arnaldo mumbling]

472
00:29:30,226 --> 00:29:33,062
No, Ivy. Don't do this.
I love you so much!

473
00:29:33,146 --> 00:29:34,564
Please forgive me!

474
00:29:34,647 --> 00:29:37,609
[tense music playing]

475
00:29:38,234 --> 00:29:41,863
Please, forgive me. Please… [sobs]

476
00:29:41,946 --> 00:29:43,406
-Arnaldo!
-Please, forgive me. Please.

477
00:29:43,490 --> 00:29:46,075
-This is humiliating!
-Forgive me, I'll do anything!

478
00:29:46,159 --> 00:29:48,119
-Arnaldo, get up!
-Don't touch me!

479
00:29:48,745 --> 00:29:50,872
-Stay out of this!
-[Emilia] Arnaldo!

480
00:29:52,707 --> 00:29:54,083
Ivy, I'm sorry.

481
00:29:54,167 --> 00:29:56,544
[sobs] Please, forgive me…

482
00:29:57,378 --> 00:30:01,549
No, don't leave me. You love me, right?

483
00:30:01,633 --> 00:30:03,968
I don't love you! I don't love you!

484
00:30:04,552 --> 00:30:06,596
I'll never love a demon like you!

485
00:30:06,679 --> 00:30:07,931
You're a demon!

486
00:30:08,014 --> 00:30:10,225
-You said you love me!
-A monster! I don't love you!

487
00:30:10,308 --> 00:30:12,227
-You love me! You love--
-I don't!

488
00:30:12,727 --> 00:30:16,356
I'll never marry a demon like you!

489
00:30:16,439 --> 00:30:20,610
You're a murderer! I will never love you!

490
00:30:20,693 --> 00:30:22,779
-No! You love me! You love me!
-No!

491
00:30:22,862 --> 00:30:24,113
-You're marrying me!
-Arnaldo!

492
00:30:24,197 --> 00:30:25,615
<i>We will get married!</i>

493
00:30:25,698 --> 00:30:27,200
You killed my daughter!

494
00:30:27,283 --> 00:30:28,201
Let's go!

495
00:30:28,284 --> 00:30:29,661
-You can't enter!
-Stop!

496
00:30:30,912 --> 00:30:32,956
-You're marrying me!
-No!

497
00:30:33,039 --> 00:30:34,165
-Arnaldo! Stop!
-[Emilia] Arnaldo!

498
00:30:35,250 --> 00:30:37,210
-[Diego] That's enough!
-[Emilia] Arnald--

499
00:30:37,293 --> 00:30:39,420
-[Fernan] He's a murderer!
-[Marlon] Let us in!

500
00:30:43,258 --> 00:30:44,467
Murderer!

501
00:30:45,885 --> 00:30:47,095
You can't enter!

502
00:30:47,512 --> 00:30:50,974
[suspenseful music playing]

503
00:30:52,016 --> 00:30:53,142
[man] Let's go, everyone!

504
00:30:54,143 --> 00:30:56,020
-Stay here!
-You can't go inside!

505
00:30:56,104 --> 00:30:58,982
[clamoring]

506
00:30:59,774 --> 00:31:03,695
[Diego] <i>It's time for you to pay</i>
<i>for all your crimes!</i>

507
00:31:03,778 --> 00:31:04,821
Arrest this man!

508
00:31:04,904 --> 00:31:08,575
Take him to prison! Arrest Arnaldo!

509
00:31:08,658 --> 00:31:11,744
Stop them! I said, stop them!

510
00:31:12,537 --> 00:31:14,581
[suspenseful music playing]

511
00:31:15,081 --> 00:31:17,292
-Stop them!
-Arnaldo!

512
00:31:17,667 --> 00:31:19,043
Where are you taking him?!

513
00:31:20,545 --> 00:31:23,339
[indistinct shouting]

514
00:31:25,300 --> 00:31:29,804
[ongoing commotion on TV]

515
00:31:31,806 --> 00:31:35,727
[inaudible]

516
00:31:36,144 --> 00:31:41,107
[clamoring]

517
00:31:41,941 --> 00:31:43,693
-[Diego] Get him!
-[Julio] Arnaldo!

518
00:31:44,444 --> 00:31:45,820
[Diego] Arrest him now!

519
00:31:45,904 --> 00:31:47,196
Take him!

520
00:31:47,280 --> 00:31:48,948
-Ivy!
-[Raul] Let go of my son!

521
00:31:49,699 --> 00:31:51,159
[clamoring]

522
00:31:51,618 --> 00:31:55,038
[suspenseful music playing]

523
00:32:00,126 --> 00:32:03,212
[inaudible]

524
00:32:07,133 --> 00:32:12,096
[suspenseful music continues]

525
00:32:25,318 --> 00:32:26,945
[music fading]

526
00:32:29,614 --> 00:32:32,617
[somber music playing]

527
00:32:33,326 --> 00:32:34,953
[Ivy] <i>This is for my father.</i>

528
00:32:43,711 --> 00:32:45,171
<i>For Mom.</i>

529
00:32:45,254 --> 00:32:46,339
[gunshot]

530
00:32:48,091 --> 00:32:49,801
<i>For Nanny Carlotta.</i>

531
00:32:53,721 --> 00:32:55,431
-<i>For Nimfa.</i>
-[gunshot]

532
00:32:58,643 --> 00:33:01,187
<i>For all those who were abused…</i>

533
00:33:01,813 --> 00:33:03,940
-<i>and treated like animals.</i>
-[gunshot]

534
00:33:04,399 --> 00:33:05,942
<i>For all those who suffered…</i>

535
00:33:07,902 --> 00:33:11,572
<i>and died in the hands of the Ardientes.</i>

536
00:33:11,656 --> 00:33:14,659
[somber music playing]

537
00:33:19,288 --> 00:33:21,082
<i>This is all for you.</i>

538
00:33:24,085 --> 00:33:29,298
<i>This is the justice I promised long ago.</i>

539
00:33:35,346 --> 00:33:40,351
[somber music playing]

540
00:33:55,867 --> 00:33:59,370
[somber music playing]

541
00:34:03,332 --> 00:34:06,878
[crowd clamoring]

542
00:34:18,681 --> 00:34:21,267
<i>-Excuse me.</i>
<i>-Mayor!</i>

543
00:34:21,976 --> 00:34:24,187
[Ivy] <i>Impressive, Mendoza.</i>

544
00:34:24,270 --> 00:34:28,733
<i>I'll transfer the money to your account,</i>
<i>but make sure to share it</i>

545
00:34:28,816 --> 00:34:30,359
-<i>with the woman you hired.</i>
-[Arnaldo screaming]

546
00:34:30,443 --> 00:34:32,361
<i>Make it stop! Make it stop!</i>

547
00:34:32,445 --> 00:34:34,906
<i>-Hon! Hon!</i>
<i>-Make it stop!</i>

548
00:34:34,989 --> 00:34:38,951
[sinister music playing]

549
00:34:40,995 --> 00:34:44,373
[Ivy] <i>Slowly but surely,</i>
<i>my plans are unfolding.</i>

550
00:34:45,041 --> 00:34:46,292
<i>But this isn't the end of it.</i>

551
00:34:46,375 --> 00:34:50,963
<i>Diego, I need to talk to Arthur</i>
<i>as soon as possible.</i>

552
00:34:51,047 --> 00:34:52,131
<i>Ready, Ivy?</i>

553
00:34:52,882 --> 00:34:59,305
<i>Five, four, three, two… action!</i>

554
00:35:03,518 --> 00:35:06,312
<i>Good morning, hon!</i>
<i>Go on, eat your breakfast.</i>

555
00:35:06,395 --> 00:35:07,855
<i>I'll just go to the restroom.</i>

556
00:35:07,939 --> 00:35:11,692
[upbeat music playing]

557
00:35:11,776 --> 00:35:13,903
[Arnaldo] <i>Twenty million pesos?</i>
<i>Are you crazy?</i>

558
00:35:13,986 --> 00:35:16,739
<i>If you're threatening me,</i>
<i>I'm not afraid of you.</i>

559
00:35:16,823 --> 00:35:18,491
<i>How about I trace this call?</i>

560
00:35:18,574 --> 00:35:20,952
<i>I'll hunt you down and kill you!</i>

561
00:35:21,035 --> 00:35:24,997
<i>I will kill-- Hello? Hello?!</i>

562
00:35:25,790 --> 00:35:29,127
<i>Hon? Who were you talking to?</i>

563
00:35:29,210 --> 00:35:30,461
<i>My staff.</i>

564
00:35:30,545 --> 00:35:32,964
[Ivy] <i>It's so hot, hon.</i>
<i>I'll go take a shower.</i>

565
00:35:33,047 --> 00:35:37,260
[upbeat music continues]

566
00:35:37,802 --> 00:35:42,014
<i>Anyway, hon, I'm sure we'll find Diego…</i>

567
00:35:42,348 --> 00:35:43,349
<i>So--</i>

568
00:35:43,432 --> 00:35:45,977
[shower running]

569
00:35:48,688 --> 00:35:49,814
[glass breaks]

570
00:35:50,648 --> 00:35:51,649
<i>Ivy?</i>

571
00:35:54,110 --> 00:35:55,111
<i>Ivy?</i>

572
00:35:56,571 --> 00:35:57,572
<i>Ivy?</i>

573
00:35:58,364 --> 00:36:01,159
[shower running]

574
00:36:02,118 --> 00:36:05,580
[suspenseful music playing]

575
00:36:11,002 --> 00:36:12,837
<i>-Thank you!</i>
<i>-Are you okay?</i>

576
00:36:13,171 --> 00:36:14,964
-<i>I'm fine.</i>
-[phone rings]

577
00:36:16,299 --> 00:36:17,925
-[phone ringing]
-<i>Who's calling?</i>

578
00:36:18,509 --> 00:36:21,262
<i>-Your mother.</i>
<i>-Don't let her know.</i>

579
00:36:22,972 --> 00:36:25,725
<i>Hello, Auntie? Yes, I'm on my way back.</i>

580
00:36:26,100 --> 00:36:27,894
<i>I just had an important matter</i>
<i>to attend to.</i>

581
00:36:30,021 --> 00:36:30,938
<i>Yes.</i>

582
00:36:33,024 --> 00:36:35,568
<i>You better get going before</i>
<i>they suspect anything.</i>

583
00:36:36,319 --> 00:36:37,528
<i>Thank you, Diego.</i>

584
00:36:38,362 --> 00:36:39,197
<i>Hello?</i>

585
00:36:39,280 --> 00:36:41,490
<i>Do you want to get Ivy Aguas back?</i>

586
00:36:41,574 --> 00:36:43,284
<i>Damn you! What do you want from me?!</i>

587
00:36:43,367 --> 00:36:44,952
<i>Face me by yourself.</i>

588
00:36:45,036 --> 00:36:47,955
<i>No Ardientes. No cops.</i>

589
00:36:48,664 --> 00:36:50,374
<i>No pesky media.</i>

590
00:36:51,334 --> 00:36:52,668
<i>Or else…</i>

591
00:36:53,794 --> 00:36:58,424
<i>Ivy Aguas will die.</i>

592
00:37:06,015 --> 00:37:07,725
<i>Who do you think you are?</i>

593
00:37:07,808 --> 00:37:10,311
<i>Do you think you can just order me around?</i>
<i>You're a nobody!</i>

594
00:37:10,394 --> 00:37:12,688
<i>And I'm the mayor! Remember that!</i>

595
00:37:12,772 --> 00:37:14,232
<i>I can easily kill you</i>

596
00:37:14,315 --> 00:37:16,275
<i>and make it look like</i>
<i>you committed suicide…</i>

597
00:37:16,609 --> 00:37:18,819
<i>just like what I did to Carlotta.</i>

598
00:37:18,903 --> 00:37:21,781
<i>Or I can also pin the blame</i>
<i>on someone else,</i>

599
00:37:21,864 --> 00:37:24,492
<i>just like how I framed Diego up</i>
<i>when I killed Nimfa.</i>

600
00:37:24,951 --> 00:37:28,663
<i>So, don't mess with me.</i>
<i>Never mess with me!</i>

601
00:37:31,249 --> 00:37:34,252
[tense music playing]

602
00:37:39,423 --> 00:37:40,925
<i>-Sir, please don't shoot!</i>
<i>-Hands up!</i>

603
00:37:41,008 --> 00:37:42,843
<i>Don't worry. We won't hurt you.</i>

604
00:37:49,100 --> 00:37:51,394
<i>The bullet-ridden body</i>
<i>of a 21-year old-woman…</i>

605
00:37:54,063 --> 00:37:55,731
[Ivy] <i>Now you know</i>

606
00:37:56,565 --> 00:38:01,028
<i>how Ivy Aguas exacts her revenge</i>

607
00:38:01,112 --> 00:38:03,489
-<i>on devils like you!</i>
-Ivy!

608
00:38:03,572 --> 00:38:05,491
[unintelligible]

609
00:38:05,574 --> 00:38:07,535
<i>You better be ready, Emilia.</i>

610
00:38:07,618 --> 00:38:09,662
-[Diego] Arrest him!
-[Arnaldo] Ivy!

611
00:38:09,745 --> 00:38:10,705
Arnaldo!

612
00:38:10,788 --> 00:38:14,292
-[Diego] Hold him down!
-[Ivy] <i>You're next on my list.</i>

613
00:38:18,754 --> 00:38:22,091
Ivy! Tell them I'm innocent!

614
00:38:22,174 --> 00:38:23,926
You killed my daughter, you monster!

615
00:38:24,010 --> 00:38:26,345
-[grunts]
-Stop it, you bastard!

616
00:38:26,429 --> 00:38:31,726
That's enough! How dare you
do that to the mayor?!

617
00:38:32,226 --> 00:38:33,269
Stop this!

618
00:38:33,352 --> 00:38:38,024
As the congressman of this town,
I'm ordering you to stop this!

619
00:38:38,107 --> 00:38:39,567
You bastards!

620
00:38:39,650 --> 00:38:40,609
-Animals!
-[guests exclaiming]

621
00:38:40,693 --> 00:38:41,819
[Arnaldo] Let go of my grandpa!

622
00:38:41,902 --> 00:38:43,946
[all exclaiming]

623
00:38:45,323 --> 00:38:46,949
[Emilia screaming] Papa!

624
00:38:51,245 --> 00:38:56,375
[suspenseful music playing]

625
00:38:59,462 --> 00:39:00,838
-Oh, no.
-[Pandoy] Diego!

626
00:39:00,921 --> 00:39:03,466
[suspenseful music playing]

627
00:39:05,509 --> 00:39:07,386
-This is all your fault!
-[Raul] Arnaldo!

628
00:39:10,056 --> 00:39:11,349
[Emilia] Arnaldo!

629
00:39:13,768 --> 00:39:19,231
[suspenseful music playing]

630
00:39:24,904 --> 00:39:27,573
-Is this really happening?
-Get inside, kids.

631
00:39:27,656 --> 00:39:29,992
That wedding is terrifying.

632
00:39:30,826 --> 00:39:32,953
[all exclaiming]

633
00:39:35,790 --> 00:39:37,041
Arnaldo!

634
00:39:37,124 --> 00:39:39,293
You've always tried to ruin
everything in my life.

635
00:39:39,377 --> 00:39:40,669
Everything!

636
00:39:40,961 --> 00:39:43,464
You ruined everything, you bastard!

637
00:39:44,340 --> 00:39:46,133
-Arnaldo!
-I'm going to finish you off!

638
00:39:46,217 --> 00:39:49,678
[suspenseful music playing]

639
00:39:53,766 --> 00:39:55,434
I'm going to end all this!

640
00:39:57,895 --> 00:39:58,979
Arnaldo.

641
00:40:00,815 --> 00:40:01,857
Go ahead, shoot.

642
00:40:03,109 --> 00:40:04,360
Do it,

643
00:40:04,443 --> 00:40:08,781
so that the people can see
who the Ardientes really are!

644
00:40:09,657 --> 00:40:12,660
So that they will all wake up
and finally see the truth.

645
00:40:13,202 --> 00:40:17,998
And I'm ready to give my life for change.

646
00:40:19,792 --> 00:40:24,296
[suspenseful music playing]

647
00:40:25,131 --> 00:40:26,090
Do it!

648
00:40:30,678 --> 00:40:33,389
Do it! Shoot me!

649
00:40:33,472 --> 00:40:35,141
-Do it!
-Diego! Wait!

650
00:40:35,224 --> 00:40:36,350
Arnaldo! Drop the gun!

651
00:40:38,644 --> 00:40:39,812
You're brothers!

652
00:40:41,689 --> 00:40:46,610
[suspenseful music playing]

653
00:40:50,072 --> 00:40:52,032
Arnaldo? Arnaldo!

654
00:40:52,825 --> 00:40:53,868
[laughs]

655
00:40:54,994 --> 00:40:55,870
-[laughs]
-[gunshot]

656
00:40:55,953 --> 00:40:58,747
-[guests exclaiming]
-[gunshots]

657
00:40:59,540 --> 00:41:02,209
[gunshots]

658
00:41:03,002 --> 00:41:04,170
[gunshot]

659
00:41:04,253 --> 00:41:05,087
[inaudible]

660
00:41:05,880 --> 00:41:07,173
[gunshot]

661
00:41:07,256 --> 00:41:08,716
-[gunshot]
-Lily!

662
00:41:08,799 --> 00:41:10,801
-Lily! My child!
-[gunshot]

663
00:41:10,885 --> 00:41:14,138
[suspenseful music playing]

664
00:41:14,221 --> 00:41:15,431
[sobs] Lily!

665
00:41:15,514 --> 00:41:16,932
[Diego] Arrest him!

666
00:41:17,016 --> 00:41:18,726
[people screaming]

667
00:41:18,809 --> 00:41:20,311
[gunshots]

668
00:41:21,437 --> 00:41:23,481
-[gunshots]
-[people screaming]

669
00:41:24,607 --> 00:41:25,774
[Diego] Get him!

670
00:41:25,858 --> 00:41:27,735
He's a criminal! Arrest him!

671
00:41:27,818 --> 00:41:31,197
[suspenseful music playing]

672
00:41:42,875 --> 00:41:43,959
Jepoy!

673
00:41:47,755 --> 00:41:48,881
Help!

674
00:41:48,964 --> 00:41:49,965
Hurry!

675
00:41:50,591 --> 00:41:51,550
Ivy…

676
00:41:51,634 --> 00:41:52,968
Let's take her to the hospital!

677
00:41:55,179 --> 00:41:56,347
Hurry!

678
00:41:59,475 --> 00:42:00,935
Jepoy, get a car!

679
00:42:01,852 --> 00:42:02,895
Ivy…

680
00:42:03,312 --> 00:42:04,313
Ivy.

681
00:42:07,900 --> 00:42:09,151
Ivy, I'm right here.

682
00:42:12,988 --> 00:42:14,365
We did it.

683
00:42:15,741 --> 00:42:17,743
["Wildflower" by Arnel Pineda playing]

684
00:42:17,826 --> 00:42:19,912
<i>♪ Let her cry ♪</i>

685
00:42:19,995 --> 00:42:24,625
<i>-Yay! We did it!</i>
<i>-♪ For she's a lady ♪</i>

686
00:42:24,708 --> 00:42:28,045
<i>♪ Let her dream ♪</i>

687
00:42:28,128 --> 00:42:31,298
<i>♪ For she's a child ♪</i>

688
00:42:31,382 --> 00:42:35,344
<i>♪ Let the rain fall down ♪</i>

689
00:42:35,427 --> 00:42:39,014
<i>♪ Upon her ♪</i>

690
00:42:39,098 --> 00:42:42,101
<i>♪ She's a free and gentle flower ♪</i>

691
00:42:42,184 --> 00:42:45,771
<i>♪ Growing wild ♪</i>

692
00:42:45,854 --> 00:42:48,440
<i>♪ Let her cry ♪</i>

693
00:42:48,524 --> 00:42:52,945
<i>♪ For she's a lady ♪</i>

694
00:42:53,028 --> 00:42:57,116
<i>-♪ Let her dream ♪</i>
-Ivy?

695
00:42:57,199 --> 00:42:59,660
<i>-♪ She's a child ♪</i>
-Ivy?

696
00:42:59,743 --> 00:43:03,747
<i>-♪ Let the rain fall down ♪</i>
-Ivy!

697
00:43:03,831 --> 00:43:06,959
♪ <i>Upon her ♪</i>

698
00:43:07,042 --> 00:43:10,713
<i>♪ She's a free and gentle flower ♪</i>

699
00:43:10,796 --> 00:43:14,341
<i>♪ Growing wild ♪</i>

700
00:43:15,050 --> 00:43:16,218
<i>Mom!</i>

701
00:43:16,302 --> 00:43:17,928
[clamoring]

702
00:43:18,470 --> 00:43:20,806
[Julio] <i>They've forgotten</i>
<i>who they're going up against.</i>

703
00:43:20,889 --> 00:43:24,351
<i>We Ardientes know</i>
<i>how to manipulate the law.</i>

704
00:43:24,435 --> 00:43:27,354
[Camia] <i>Ivy is Lily Cruz.</i>
<i>She is my daughter.</i>

705
00:43:27,438 --> 00:43:30,107
<i>I'm the mayor here! Why am I in jail?!</i>

706
00:43:30,190 --> 00:43:32,151
<i>You! You ruined our family!</i>

707
00:43:32,234 --> 00:43:36,363
[Diego] <i>You'll rot in jail.</i>
<i>You will never get Ivy back.</i>

708
00:43:37,781 --> 00:43:39,325
<i>-Ivy!</i>
<i>-Did you miss me?</i>

709
00:43:39,408 --> 00:43:40,576
<i>-Yes.</i>
<i>-Screw you!</i>

710
00:43:40,659 --> 00:43:42,578
<i>Say hi to Emilia for me.</i>

711
00:43:42,661 --> 00:43:47,249
<i>Tell your mom that she's about</i>
<i>to get what she's looking for.</i>

712
00:43:47,333 --> 00:43:49,251
<i>Ivy! Ivy!</i>

713
00:43:49,335 --> 00:43:52,087
<i>This is all your fault!</i>
<i>It's all your fault!</i>

714
00:43:52,171 --> 00:43:53,172
[Raul] <i>Arnaldo!</i>

715
00:43:53,714 --> 00:43:56,675
[Emilia] <i>I can smell the traitor</i>
<i>in that Ivy Aguas, Papa.</i>

716
00:43:56,759 --> 00:43:59,219
<i>She plotted everything</i>
<i>to bring Arnaldo down!</i>

717
00:43:59,303 --> 00:44:00,387
<i>We should kill her!</i>

718
00:44:00,471 --> 00:44:03,807
[Julio] <i>You were the golden boy</i>
<i>of our family.</i>

719
00:44:03,891 --> 00:44:07,811
<i>How could you let your life</i>
<i>be ruined by a woman?!</i>

720
00:44:07,895 --> 00:44:10,898
<i>Give me Ivy. Please, Grandpa…</i>

721
00:44:10,981 --> 00:44:12,107
<i>Give me Ivy…</i>

722
00:44:12,191 --> 00:44:16,528
[Julio] <i>Ivy Aguas' funeral is</i>
<i>postponed until further notice.</i>

723
00:44:16,612 --> 00:44:17,655
[screams]

724
00:44:17,738 --> 00:44:20,074
<i>I'm here to make you an offer, Ivy.</i>

725
00:44:20,157 --> 00:44:21,992
<i>A hundred million pesos.</i>

726
00:44:22,076 --> 00:44:24,161
<i>-In exchange for what?</i>
<i>-Get back together with my grandson.</i>

727
00:44:24,244 --> 00:44:25,412
[Camia] <i>What are you going to do?</i>

728
00:44:25,496 --> 00:44:29,249
<i>Are you going to help Arnaldo recover</i>
<i>after you tore him down?</i>

729
00:44:29,333 --> 00:44:31,835
[Ivy] <i>Arnaldo is the weakness</i>
<i>of the Ardientes--</i>

730
00:44:31,919 --> 00:44:34,880
<i>Emilia, Raul, and especially Julio.</i>

731
00:44:34,963 --> 00:44:39,968
<i>So I need Arnaldo to finish off</i>
<i>the Ardientes once and for all.</i>

732
00:44:40,052 --> 00:44:42,554
<i>Let the games begin.</i>

733
00:44:42,638 --> 00:44:44,848
<i>Charges against Mayor</i>
<i>Arnaldo Torillo were dismissed.</i>

734
00:44:44,932 --> 00:44:46,517
[Camia] <i>They've proven yet again</i>

735
00:44:46,600 --> 00:44:48,602
<i>that they have the law at their disposal.</i>

736
00:44:50,771 --> 00:44:52,147
<i>Arnaldo… Arnaldo!</i>

737
00:44:52,231 --> 00:44:53,482
-<i>Arnaldo, enough!</i>
-[chuckles]

738
00:44:53,565 --> 00:44:56,235
<i>You have to accept the fact</i>
<i>that Arnaldo is not well!</i>

739
00:44:56,318 --> 00:44:59,446
<i>No one tells Julio Ardiente what to do!</i>

740
00:44:59,530 --> 00:45:03,367
<i>I need to be with the Ardientes</i>
<i>so I can protect you.</i>

741
00:45:03,450 --> 00:45:07,704
<i>Don't you dare go near my son!</i>
<i>We aren't done yet!</i>

742
00:45:07,788 --> 00:45:12,334
[Ivy] <i>Death doesn't suit you.</i>
<i>You deserve something worse.</i>

743
00:45:12,418 --> 00:45:17,339
<i>An Ardiente never loses.</i>
<i>An Ardiente never dies.</i>

744
00:45:19,466 --> 00:45:20,884
[maid] <i>Ma'am Emilia!</i>

745
00:45:21,718 --> 00:45:23,720
[shrieking]

746
00:45:23,804 --> 00:45:27,182
[theme music playing]
